  "description": "A .NET MAUI plugin that brings full OpenType variable font axis control to your app. Set Weight, Width, Slant, Optical Size, and dozens of other axes directly from XAML using simple attached properties — no custom renderers required. Works consistently across Android, iOS, macOS (Mac Catalyst), and Windows with a unified cross-platform API.",
